{
  "_": [
    "The order the parts concatenate in. The shims capture each other's",
    "closures inside ONE arrow scope, so order is behavior, not layout.",
    "`c` is the full bootstrap the QuickJS island embeds. `rust` is the",
    "subset the boa island can serve honestly today: every part whose host",
    "surface the Rust bridge implements. A part missing from `rust` leaves",
    "its builtin unregistered, which is the island's does-not-provide",
    "throw — an honest fence, not a silent wrong answer."
  ],
